WEBVTT

00:15.100 --> 00:21.910
Kokoro no mori no naka kimi ni deau koto

00:15.100 --> 00:21.910
I was always dreaming of meeting you

00:16.100 --> 00:22.150
<b>Zettai Shonen</b>

00:21.910 --> 00:26.980
Itsumo yume mitetan da

00:21.910 --> 00:26.980
within my heart’s forest.

00:26.980 --> 00:33.120
Hikari no silhouette sono saki wo mezashite

00:26.980 --> 00:33.120
The silhouette of light guides the way.

00:33.120 --> 00:38.750
Itsuka ai ni furete mitai

00:33.120 --> 00:38.750
One day, I’d like to try and experience love.

00:38.750 --> 00:44.460
Kimochi to kotoba niji to mizutamari

00:38.750 --> 00:44.460
My feelings and words can be like rainbows and puddles.

00:44.460 --> 00:51.870
Omoiau yasashisa ga michibiku ashita he to

00:44.460 --> 00:51.870
The kindness we share will guide us into tomorrow.

00:51.870 --> 00:57.370
Kimi ga iru dake de tsuyoku nareru kara

00:51.870 --> 00:57.370
With only you here, I can become stronger.

00:57.370 --> 01:03.670
Sora takaku negai wo kanadeyou

00:57.370 --> 01:03.670
My wish will be granted in the heights of the sky.

01:03.670 --> 01:09.050
Nanika taisetsu ka wo miushinawanu you ni

01:03.670 --> 01:09.050
You won’t lose sight of something precious to you,

01:09.050 --> 01:18.320
Kitto motto kagayaku kara

01:09.050 --> 01:18.320
because I’m sure it’ll shine even brighter.

01:18.320 --> 01:23.770
Kimi ga iru dake de tsuyoku nareru no sa

01:18.320 --> 01:23.770
With only you here, I can become stronger.

01:23.770 --> 01:30.130
Ima dekiru koto kara hajimeyou

01:23.770 --> 01:30.130
Let’s start with what we can do right now.

01:30.130 --> 01:35.510
Mawarimichi demo ii jibun wo shinjite

01:30.130 --> 01:35.510
I don’t mind if we take a detour, 
as long as you believe in yourself.

01:35.510 --> 01:44.620
Kitto motto sono saki he to

01:35.510 --> 01:44.620
By doing that, I’m sure we can go even further.

02:06.380 --> 02:08.010
<b>You’re up next with “ta.”</b>

02:08.010 --> 02:09.050
<b>Yeah.</b>

02:09.050 --> 02:11.080
<b>Ta... tanuki! [raccoon dog]</b>

02:11.080 --> 02:13.650
<b>Umm... kirigirisu! [grasshopper]</b>

02:13.650 --> 02:15.720
<b>Su... suzume! [sparrow]</b>

02:15.720 --> 02:16.850
<b>Medaka! [guppy]</b>

02:16.860 --> 02:18.860
<b>Umm...</b>

02:18.860 --> 02:19.760
<b>Kasa! [umbrella]</b>

02:19.760 --> 02:22.090
<b>Sa... saifu! [wallet]</b>

02:22.090 --> 02:23.530
<b>Let’s see...</b>

02:24.560 --> 02:25.500
<b>Futa! [lid]</b>

02:25.500 --> 02:26.500
<b>Tako! [octopus]</b>

02:26.500 --> 02:27.900
<b>Koi! [carp]</b>

02:27.900 --> 02:29.920
<b>I...</b>

02:29.920 --> 02:32.440
<b>I... tomaki! [spool of thread]</b>

02:32.440 --> 02:34.410
<b>Ki...</b>

02:34.410 --> 02:35.510
<b>Kitsune. [fox]</b>

02:35.510 --> 02:37.380
<b>Ne... neko! [cat]</b>

02:37.380 --> 02:39.610
<b>Umm...</b>

02:39.610 --> 02:41.080
<b>Konpyuuta! [computer]</b>

02:41.080 --> 02:42.050
<b>What?</b>

02:42.050 --> 02:43.780
<b>Konpyuuta!</b>

02:43.780 --> 02:45.020
<b>What’s that?</b>

02:45.020 --> 02:48.190
<b>It’s kinda like a TV... like where
you see a video playing.</b>

02:48.190 --> 02:49.490
<b>I don’t know what it is.</b>

02:49.490 --> 02:51.690
<b>Huh? It’s pretty much just a TV!</b>

02:51.690 --> 02:52.860
<b>What’s that?</b>

02:52.860 --> 02:54.430
<b>Don’t you watch anime?</b>

02:54.430 --> 02:55.490
<b>I don’t know what that is...</b>

02:55.490 --> 02:57.190
<b>Don’t you have a TV?</b>

02:57.200 --> 02:58.700
<b>I don’t know what that is...</b>

02:59.200 --> 03:01.070
<b>Well, next... you go from “ta”!</b>

03:01.070 --> 03:02.630
<b>From the “ta” in konpyuuta!</b>

03:02.630 --> 03:04.370
<b>Uh... tanbo. [rice paddy]</b>

03:04.370 --> 03:06.670
<b>Bo... bonasu! [bonus]</b>

03:06.670 --> 03:07.710
<b>What’s that?</b>

03:16.950 --> 03:18.380
<b>I’m going home.</b>

03:18.380 --> 03:21.120
<b>Okay! See you tomorrow!</b>

03:22.350 --> 03:24.090
<b>Umm. Wakkun...</b>

03:25.690 --> 03:32.660
<b>The Heaviness of a Promise
and the Lightness of a Dream</b>

03:45.540 --> 03:46.140
<b>There!</b>

03:48.880 --> 03:50.280
<b>I’m sorry.</b>

03:50.280 --> 03:51.650
<b>Be careful, okay?</b>

03:51.650 --> 03:52.650
<b>Yeah!</b>

03:54.920 --> 03:56.420
<b>This one’s big...</b>

03:58.060 --> 03:59.020
<b>There!</b>

04:04.630 --> 04:06.060
<b>Having fun?</b>

04:06.060 --> 04:07.400
<b>Yeah!</b>

04:09.670 --> 04:11.000
<b>Are you going home?</b>

04:11.000 --> 04:13.270
<b>I should be heading back soon...</b>

04:13.270 --> 04:14.310
<b>Then, see you–</b>

04:14.310 --> 04:18.080
<b>Hey, what do you always do 
after I go home?</b>

04:19.640 --> 04:21.110
<b>Play.</b>

04:21.110 --> 04:22.180
<b>Where?</b>

04:22.180 --> 04:23.610
<b>Here.</b>

04:23.620 --> 04:25.520
<b>You play here the whole time?</b>

04:25.520 --> 04:27.490
<b>Amu, see you tomorrow!</b>

04:27.490 --> 04:28.920
<b>You promised!</b>

04:42.470 --> 04:44.040
<b>Thank you very much!</b>

04:46.340 --> 04:48.410
<b>Hey...</b>

04:48.410 --> 04:49.910
<b>What’ve you been up to recently?</b>

04:49.910 --> 04:53.240
<b>I hear you’ve been going up the
Nakizawagawa River every day?</b>

04:54.180 --> 04:55.750
<b>If you already know, why ask?</b>

04:55.750 --> 04:57.550
<b>Aren’t you hiding something from us?</b>

04:57.550 --> 04:58.320
<b>Not really.</b>

04:58.320 --> 04:59.980
<b>Aizawa!</b>

04:59.990 --> 05:02.050
<b>You called me by my name for the first time.</b>

05:02.050 --> 05:03.890
<b>Ah, ignore that.</b>

05:03.890 --> 05:05.790
<b>So? What have you been doing?</b>

05:05.790 --> 05:07.360
<b>Seriously, nothing much.</b>

05:08.330 --> 05:10.430
<b>And I wouldn’t say I’m “hiding” anything...</b>

05:10.430 --> 05:13.000
<b>More like nothing even needs 
to be mentioned.</b>

05:13.000 --> 05:14.870
<b>No, I don’t know after <i>that</i>...</b>

05:14.870 --> 05:15.930
<b>After what?</b>

05:15.930 --> 05:17.740
<b>You lied to Sukawara.</b>

05:17.740 --> 05:20.470
<b>I don’t like being lied to, either.</b>

05:20.470 --> 05:22.140
<b>I’m not lying.</b>

05:22.140 --> 05:24.740
<b>There are no kappas up the Nakizawagawa River.</b>

05:24.740 --> 05:26.280
<b>I really don’t think they’re there.</b>

05:26.280 --> 05:28.250
<b>I did see Old Lady Okaka up there once, though.</b>

05:28.250 --> 05:29.450
<b>That’s all there is.</b>

05:29.450 --> 05:30.750
<b>Nothing else?</b>

05:30.750 --> 05:31.820
<b>No, not a thing.</b>

05:32.620 --> 05:33.720
<b>You’re such a liar.</b>

05:33.720 --> 05:36.090
<b>If that’s what you want to think, fine.</b>

05:37.290 --> 05:38.620
<b>Hey, wait!</b>

05:38.620 --> 05:40.520
<b>Hey, Aizawa!</b>

05:40.530 --> 05:42.090
<b>Is something wrong?</b>

05:42.090 --> 05:43.790
<b>Ah, it’s nothing.</b>

06:08.690 --> 06:09.890
<b>Do you have a minute?</b>

06:09.890 --> 06:11.120
<b>Y-Yeah...</b>

06:14.260 --> 06:18.030
<b>I was out walking, 
and I just happened to see you.</b>

06:18.030 --> 06:19.430
<b>I wonder if this is really all right...</b>

06:19.430 --> 06:20.930
<b>I need to relax every now and then.</b>

06:20.930 --> 06:25.440
<b>Not that. Aren’t you going out with Unno, Takkun?</b>

06:25.440 --> 06:26.400
<b>You think so?</b>

06:26.410 --> 06:27.710
<b>But...</b>

06:27.710 --> 06:29.910
<b>I don’t intend to go out with her.</b>

06:31.310 --> 06:33.380
<b>Isn’t that kind of cruel?</b>

06:33.380 --> 06:35.180
<b>Why?</b>

06:35.180 --> 06:37.720
<b>What about you, 
with Sakakura and that guy...</b>

06:37.720 --> 06:38.980
<b>The one at Dr. Kishiro’s place.</b>

06:38.980 --> 06:40.180
<b>Aizawa-kun?</b>

06:40.190 --> 06:42.090
<b>You don’t think you’re going out
with either of them, right?</b>

06:42.090 --> 06:43.390
<b>It’s the same thing with me.</b>

06:43.390 --> 06:44.860
<b>It’s different!</b>

06:44.860 --> 06:49.230
<b>Sakakura and Aizawa-kun don’t think
they’re going out with me...</b>

06:49.230 --> 06:52.800
<b>...but Unno thinks you two are going out.</b>

06:52.800 --> 06:55.200
<b>Well, I don’t care either way.</b>

06:55.200 --> 06:56.900
<b>I’m... gonna head back inside.</b>

07:06.340 --> 07:07.880
<b>Don’t surprise me like that!</b>

07:07.880 --> 07:10.110
<b>You were running late,
so I was told to go find you.</b>

07:10.120 --> 07:11.550
<b>It’s nothing.</b>

