07:30.270 --> 07:32.540
<b>What... is all this?</b>

07:46.150 --> 07:47.350
<b>Ayumu!</b>

07:47.350 --> 07:48.950
<b>Could you come to the exam room?</b>

07:56.630 --> 07:58.160
<b>Sorry.</b>

07:58.160 --> 08:01.630
<b>I just stopped by to pick up some filarial medicine.</b>

08:03.600 --> 08:05.840
<b>This is Taruto. Isn’t she cute?</b>

08:07.910 --> 08:08.870
<b>You don’t like dogs?</b>

08:08.870 --> 08:11.180
<b>That’s not it...</b>

08:11.180 --> 08:12.580
<b>Do you need something from me?</b>

08:12.580 --> 08:15.310
<b>You still don’t want to see me, 
even when you have nothing else to do?</b>

08:15.310 --> 08:16.110
<b>I dunno...</b>

08:16.110 --> 08:17.310
<b>Unno-san.</b>

08:17.320 --> 08:18.880
<b>Geez...</b>

08:18.880 --> 08:20.320
<b>Umm...</b>

08:20.850 --> 08:23.090
<b>Could you hold this for me?</b>

08:35.830 --> 08:36.870
<b>Look at it later.</b>

08:40.440 --> 08:42.110
<b>Here’s your bill.</b>

08:42.110 --> 08:42.870
<b>Okay.</b>

08:42.870 --> 08:46.540
<b>E-mail</b>

08:42.870 --> 08:46.540
<b>Cell Phone</b>

08:42.870 --> 08:46.540
<b>Unno Shione</b>

08:42.870 --> 08:46.540
<b>Hope to hear
from you soon</b>

08:43.800 --> 08:45.870
<b>And here’s your change.</b>

08:45.870 --> 08:47.080
<b>Will you be all right with the rain?</b>

08:46.540 --> 08:52.310
<b>Kishiro Animal Hospital</b>

08:47.080 --> 08:49.580
<b>Oh, a car’s waiting for me out front, so...</b>

08:49.580 --> 08:51.120
<b>Ah, I see.</b>

08:51.120 --> 08:52.320
<b>In that case, take care.</b>

08:55.950 --> 08:58.290
<b>Are you normally like that?</b>

08:59.560 --> 09:02.530
<b>I’m not sure if you were being
non-charming or just clumsy...</b>

09:02.530 --> 09:04.560
<b>From the other room, it sounded
like you were pretty anxious.</b>

09:06.330 --> 09:07.570
<b>I’m just not interested.</b>

09:35.150 --> 09:37.560
<b>Special Sale Announcement</b>

09:35.150 --> 09:37.560
<b>For the Day of the Cat Dance</b>

09:35.150 --> 09:37.560
<b>Tanaya</b>

09:35.150 --> 09:37.560
<b></b>All boxed meals

09:35.150 --> 09:37.560
<b></b>50 yen off

09:35.150 --> 09:37.560
<b></b>All drinks 30 yen off

09:35.150 --> 09:37.560
<b></b>All rice balls
30 yen off

09:46.170 --> 09:47.270
<b>Oh, my.</b>

09:52.280 --> 09:53.640
<b>Why don’t you come inside?</b>

09:54.410 --> 09:57.210
<b>What were you doing out in the rain?</b>

09:57.220 --> 09:59.850
<b>When I left, it was just drizzling...</b>

10:02.020 --> 10:04.490
<b>You couldn’t wait till it passed?</b>

10:05.490 --> 10:11.100
<b>Pushing yourself too hard might finish things
sooner than you expect, you know.</b>

10:11.100 --> 10:12.290
<b>I’m not...</b>

10:14.370 --> 10:16.300
<b>It’s fine if you want to go up there, but...</b>

10:16.300 --> 10:18.970
<b>...if you start to feel obligated,
then that’s not really good...</b>

10:38.320 --> 10:42.120
<b>Secondary River Channel</b>

11:04.650 --> 11:05.650
<b>Dad?</b>

11:06.590 --> 11:07.720
<b>Yeah.</b>

11:07.720 --> 11:09.620
<b>The rain’s coming down pretty hard...</b>

11:09.620 --> 11:13.060
<b>...so I was hoping you could pick me up
if you had a spare second...</b>

11:45.590 --> 11:52.520
<b>Kishiro Animal Hospital</b>

12:52.560 --> 12:53.460
<b>When did you...?</b>

12:53.460 --> 12:54.360
<b>Sorry.</b>

12:54.360 --> 12:56.060
<b>It would’ve been no fun if you ran away...</b>

12:56.060 --> 12:58.800
<b>...so I kept my engine running
low and followed you here.</b>

12:58.800 --> 13:00.800
<b>Who would run from you?</b>

13:00.800 --> 13:03.500
<b>You’ve been acting strange.</b>

13:03.500 --> 13:05.340
<b>And that’s coming from <i>me</i>...</b>

13:05.340 --> 13:08.910
<b>...and people always say I’m strange
since I’m always chasing after cats.</b>

13:08.910 --> 13:11.780
<b>And I’m telling you,
you’re acting pretty darn strange.</b>

13:12.380 --> 13:15.010
<b>I know. I hear that a lot.</b>

13:16.310 --> 13:18.280
<b>Hey! Come on!</b>

13:18.280 --> 13:21.520
<b>Tell me! What do you do down there?</b>

13:21.520 --> 13:22.820
<b>I play.</b>

13:23.860 --> 13:24.660
<b>Probably.</b>

13:24.660 --> 13:26.320
<b>What the heck’s with that?</b>

13:26.320 --> 13:27.830
<b>I don’t really understand, to be honest.</b>

13:40.610 --> 13:41.870
<b>Stupid mutt! That tickles!</b>

13:41.870 --> 13:42.740
<b>Sekine</b>

13:42.770 --> 13:44.670
<b>Ozawa</b>

13:44.640 --> 13:46.340
<b>Tana</b>

14:15.010 --> 14:15.940
<b>Heading home from cram school?</b>

14:15.940 --> 14:18.480
<b>Yeah. What about you?</b>

14:18.480 --> 14:19.440
<b>Out shopping.</b>

14:19.440 --> 14:21.950
<b>I was buying some cloth to make
my costume for the Cat Dance.</b>

14:21.950 --> 14:23.310
<b>You make it yourself?</b>

14:23.320 --> 14:24.380
<b>Yeah, I always do.</b>

14:24.380 --> 14:27.320
<b>When small festivals are such
a pain in the first place...</b>

14:27.320 --> 14:29.350
<b>...that’s pretty impressive, being able to do that.</b>

14:29.350 --> 14:31.820
<b>Well... to each her own, I guess...</b>

14:42.670 --> 14:43.500
<b>Hey.</b>

14:45.970 --> 14:48.040
<b>I...</b>

14:48.040 --> 14:50.140
<b>...hate you.</b>

14:50.880 --> 14:52.780
<b>We will now depart for Tana.</b>

